    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have you ever ordered something online and waited soooooo long for the delivery, that you thought: <i>\u201eOMG, I would deliver it in a few hours\u201d?</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well\u2026 <strong>Prove it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604810/extras/989c5ea89e348a13c18dd517cebea7f7.avif?t=1743974508\" width=800 height=533 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of logistics and build your delivery empire in this thrilling tycoon game! From small packages to large shipments, it\u2019s up to you to ensure they reach their destinations intact and on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small fleet and expand it with new cars, trucks and planes, each with its  unique capabilities, and hire a dedicated team of employees to keep everything running smoothly. As your business grows, you\u2019ll be able to unlock new cities and upgrade your sorting depots, enhancing efficiency and speeding up deliveries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604810/extras/ded262bab71a83763ff569b95c8c92dd.avif?t=1743974508\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up automated sorting systems, optimize delivery routes, and let your team handle the heavy lifting, freeing you up to focus on expanding your empire even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With advanced tech at your disposal, watch your parcel deliveries run like a well-oiled machine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604810/extras/19bdacdc60ecf01b8daadf68a2d8ac5d.avif?t=1743974508\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on exciting in-game events like the chaos of Christmas sales, or face the unexpected hurdles of roadworks or flights delayed due to weather, forcing you to rethink your delivery routes and adapt your strategies. With each challenge, your skills as a logistics tycoon will be tested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you rise to the top, manage the demands of a growing business, and deliver parcels faster than the competition? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604810/extras/d03a09eac5eca65aea0241097d984aae.avif?t=1743974508\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have you ever ordered something online and waited soooooo long for the delivery, that you thought: <i>\u201eOMG, I would deliver it in a few hours\u201d?</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well\u2026 <strong>Prove it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604810/extras/989c5ea89e348a13c18dd517cebea7f7.avif?t=1743974508\" width=800 height=533 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of logistics and build your delivery empire in this thrilling tycoon game! From small packages to large shipments, it\u2019s up to you to ensure they reach their destinations intact and on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small fleet and expand it with new cars, trucks and planes, each with its  unique capabilities, and hire a dedicated team of employees to keep everything running smoothly. As your business grows, you\u2019ll be able to unlock new cities and upgrade your sorting depots, enhancing efficiency and speeding up deliveries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604810/extras/ded262bab71a83763ff569b95c8c92dd.avif?t=1743974508\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up automated sorting systems, optimize delivery routes, and let your team handle the heavy lifting, freeing you up to focus on expanding your empire even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With advanced tech at your disposal, watch your parcel deliveries run like a well-oiled machine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604810/extras/19bdacdc60ecf01b8daadf68a2d8ac5d.avif?t=1743974508\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on exciting in-game events like the chaos of Christmas sales, or face the unexpected hurdles of roadworks or flights delayed due to weather, forcing you to rethink your delivery routes and adapt your strategies. With each challenge, your skills as a logistics tycoon will be tested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you rise to the top, manage the demands of a growing business, and deliver parcels faster than the competition? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604810/extras/d03a09eac5eca65aea0241097d984aae.avif?t=1743974508\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Become a CEO of your own delivery company. Transport parcels from A to B, expand your fleet and depots. Face multiple challenges and earn as much money as you can.",
